        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Look at the photo's what they did, left a Plier on the air line after installing new brakes, drums and new Tires on that axle. the New tire blew again after driving 300 km. when I Called the person jawanda in Montreal shop he said fix it and i will return you the money for your repair. when the repair done I call him after a week and after attending my few calls and making excuses, Now when I call him he just hang up my phone. so please stay away from these kind of people. i wish i can give them negative stars but there is no option for negative stars. this may cause an accident. their work Invoice attached.",
